    "display_name": "Community Events",
    "long_instructions": "## Compare Data Completeness\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Look through the `events` array.\r\n2. Compare how much information each event has.\r\n3. Focus on the `description` field across events.\r\n\r\n\r\n### **Reflect:**\r\n\r\n- Which events have more detailed information?\r\n- Which have less or missing information?\r\n- Which event would you be more likely to attend? Why?",
